                            <comment id="18041781" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 1 Dec 2025 09:53:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;As discussed in the original &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/issues/11960&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;GitHub issue&lt;/a&gt;, this is likely not a bug. The user has to set &lt;b&gt;IgniteConfiguration.localhost&lt;/b&gt; to the proper host name for this scenario to work (I have tested that .NET client will use the configured host name in this case). Otherwise Ignite has no way of knowing the correct host name to use.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
